                <pb facs="0737" n="651" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg651"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Carothers to Mr. Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Torreon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic">February 28,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Brakeman McVea was acquitted about May 25 last year; has left the country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
